WEBVTT

00:17:26.514 --> 00:17:32.825
Where does your passion lie?
And choose that field.

00:17:32.825 --> 00:17:36.120
You must use technology,
because that is the future.

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:40.500
Both these points are important. 
Those listening at home, keep it in mind.

00:17:41.163 --> 00:17:45.673
Sundar is very busy,
he took the time out for us

00:17:45.674 --> 00:17:51.286
Thank you once again Sundar,
you took out the time for us.

00:17:51.286 --> 00:17:52.544
And because he is busy--

00:17:52.544 --> 00:17:54.604
(Applause)

00:17:55.544 --> 00:17:59.946
I have two personal agendas,
but I will talk work first.

00:17:59.946 --> 00:18:03.376
I want a Selfie with Sundar,
which I have to do.